// AGENCY OST — 10 · Black ICE
// ACT II. The Agency deploys its own countermeasure AI. Darksynth in the
// Perturbator mold: the bass IS the riff — staccato, distorted, full of
// holes — and the whole mix stops with it. Sub-sine doubles the riff for
// the concrete low end; the stops let the gated snare's tail hang.
//
// FORM (106 BPM · 1 cycle = 1 bar · 64 bars ≈ 2:25 · loops):
//   intro  8  e1  cold pad + warning arp; the ICE compiles
//   riff   16 e4  THE RIFF: bass+sub in lockstep, half-time gated snare
//   surge  8  e5  + harmonic-minor lead over the riff
//   stall  8  e2  hard stop — riff gone, heartbeat kick, pad tail
//   riff2  16 e5  full: riff + lead + open hats
//   outro  8  e1  the riff decays to single hits; pad closes
// hook: the stop-riff — bars end in silence, bar 4 cuts at the half.

setbpm(106);

